        "comments": "CAEBRE_CFB2252 assembly of Caenorhabditis brenneri. The genome was generated form a highly inbred strain, CFB2252, using PacBio CLR reads with FALCON. Contigs were polished with Illumina reads using Pilon, scaffolded using Hi-C data with the 3D-DNA pipeline, and polished again with PacBio HiFi reads, the assembly gaps were closed with PacBio HiFi and polished CLR reads using LR_Gapcloser and TGS-GapCloser. For genome annotation, we utilized RNA-seq and Iso-Seq data along with protein sequences from related Caenorhabditis nematodes.",
